          "unit_id": "job_interview",
          "title": "The Interview",
          "description": "Habla de tu experiencia en una entrevista: present perfect frente a past simple. Y conectores para argumentar: however, therefore, on the other hand, although.",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "lesson_id": "interview_experience",
              "title": "Present perfect vs past simple",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "The interview",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "So, Lucía, you've worked here for six months now. What have you learned?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "A lot. When I arrived, I didn't know anyone, and it took me a few weeks to learn the ropes. Now I feel at home."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "Have you ever managed a team?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Yes, I have. In Madrid I managed three junior designers for a year."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "When did you finish that job?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I left in August, just before I moved to Bristol."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "And what's the most difficult project you've worked on here?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "The museum website. We had a very short deadline, so I worked late every night that week."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "Yes, I remember. You really went the extra mile."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Thank you. I've always enjoyed a challenge."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "The senior designer will have to take on two new clients. Are you ready for that?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Absolutely. I've been waiting for an opportunity like this."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Helen",
                        "text": "Good. I'll let you know next week."
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "March. Harbour Studio is growing, and Helen needs a senior designer. Lucía has applied for the job, and today is her interview."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "phase": "discovery",
                  "type": "multiple_choice",
                  "content": {
